ark where Nexon's characters such as Dao and Bazzi appear. Interact with total strangers and make new friends online. Crazy World VR offers various mini-games you can play with others online, together with social & customization features. ", "short_description": "Crazy World VR is a multiplayer social VR game developed by Pixelity Games(formerly known as PIXELPIMPS) in association with SKTelecom utilizing Nexon\u2019s casual IP. \nThe game offers various mini games you can play with others online, together with social features, and various customization features."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pixelitygames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://pixelitygames.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Pixelity Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pixelitygames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "SOCIAL", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "217541127857094"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974547_285589939634409_6419590274807059468_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N2Cg2tINiPQQ7kNvwH1hu-i&_nc_oc=Adpxt_u_g-aT5wNMxqJ6YFWe1tUm1zxeEqvYSeFbzQU3hqStFVSRTi7pCsH3SpcwC10&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ5RWof1auP1DWxt-oli1aM4xZhGcgIPneV8Z52jnjP5Q&oe=6B0455DF"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Crazy World VR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Party Game", "id": "1700921480735423"}], "release_date": 1623279625, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "988660838209320", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "3849002888453838", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "225036001842495"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1527604530770615", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\ud06c\ub808\uc774\uc9c0\uc6d4\ub4dc VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "- NEXON \uce90\uc8fc\uc5bc \uac8c\uc784 IP\ub97c VR \uc138\uc0c1\uc5d0\uc11c \ub9cc\ub098\uc790!\n\ud06c\ub808\uc774\uc9c0 \uc6d4\ub4dc VR\uc740 NEXON\uc758 \uc720\uba85 \uce90\uc8fc\uc5bc \uac8c\uc784\uc778 \uce74\ud2b8\ub77c\uc774\ub354, \ud06c\ub808\uc774\uc9c0\uc544\ucf00\uc774\ub4dc, \ubc84\ube14\ud30c\uc774\ud130\uc758 IP\ub97c \ud65c\uc6a9\ud55c \ub2e4\uc911 \uc811\uc18d VR \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc775\uc219\ud55c \uce90\ub9ad\ud130\ub4e4\uacfc \ud568\uaed8 VR \uc138\uacc4\ub97c \ud0d0\ud5d8\ud574 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694.\n\n- \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uacfc \ud568\uaed8 VR \uc6d4\ub4dc\ub97c \uc990\uae30\uc790!\n\ud06c\ub808\uc774\uc9c0 \uc6d4\ub4dc VR\uc740 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uacfc \ud568\uaed8 \uc990\uae38 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub808\uc774 \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5ec\ub7ec \uc720\uc800\ub4e4\uc774 \ub3d9\uc2dc \uc811\uc18d \uac00\ub2a5\ud55c \ub9c8\uc744\uc5d0\uc11c \uc720\uc800 \uac04 \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \uc0c1\ud638\uc791\uc6a9\uc744 \ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uce90\ub9ad\ud130 \ucee4\uc2a4\ud130\ub9c8\uc774\uc9d5, \ub9c8\uc774 \ub8f8 \uafb8\ubbf8\uae30 \ub4f1 \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \uc990\uac70\uc6c0\ub3c4 \uc81c\uacf5\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n- \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \ubbf8\ub2c8 \uac8c\uc784\n\ud06c\ub808\uc774\uc9c0 \uc6d4\ub4dc VR\uc740 \uc27d\uace0 \uac04\ud3b8\ud55c \uc870\uc791\uc73c\ub85c \ub204\uad6c\ub098 \uc990\uae38 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 VR \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub9c8\uc744 \uacf3\uacf3\uc5d0\uc11c \uc0dd\uc131\ub418\ub294 \ub8e8\ucc0c\ub97c \ud68d\ub4dd\ud558\uc5ec \uac8c\uc784\uc744 \ub9c8\uc74c\uaecf \uc990\uaca8\ubcf4\uc138\uc694.  \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uacfc \ud568\uaed8 \uae30\ub85d\uc744 \uacbd\uc7c1\ud574 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694!\n\n* \ubcf8 \uac8c\uc784\uc740 \uc628\ub77c\uc778 \uac8c\uc784\uc73c\ub85c \uc778\ud130\ub137 \uc5f0\uacb0\uc744 \ud544\uc218\ub85c \uc694\uad6c\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.", "short_description": "\uc990\uac70\uc6b4 VR \uc6d4\ub4dc\uc5d0 \uc624\uc2e0 \uac83\uc744 \ud658\uc601\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4! \ud06c\ub808\uc774\uc9c0 \uc6d4\ub4dc VR\uc740 NEXON\uc758 \uc720\uba85 \uce90\uc8fc\uc5bc \uac8c\uc784\uc778 \uce74\ud2b8\ub77c\uc774\ub354, \ud06c\ub808\uc774\uc9c0\uc544\ucf00\uc774\ub4dc, \ubc84\ube14\ud30c\uc774\ud130\uc758 IP\ub97c \ud65c\uc6a9\ud55c \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub808\uc774 VR \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc775\uc219\ud55c \uce90\ub9ad\ud130\ub4e4\uacfc \ud568\uaed8 VR\uc5d0\uc11c \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \ubbf8\ub2c8 \uac8c\uc784\ub4e4, \uce90\ub9ad\ud130 \uafb8\ubbf8\uae30, \uc18c\uc15c \uae30\ub2a5 \ub4f1\uc744 \uc990\uae38 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. VR \uc6d4\ub4dc\uc5d0\uc11c \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uacfc \ud568\uaed8 \uc990\uac70\uc6b4 \uacbd\ud5d8\uc744 \ud574\ubcf4\uc138\uc694!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "2560x1440_03.png", "id": "4094666597218615", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035313_4094666600551948_227043978261132322_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5VM3kUdcPuwQ7kNvwFgJBl9&_nc_oc=AdoOZYoZXVZk-tgfQt_ckg_9mvvSC0lnYr3cP8AJOoAqwkQHz7eG2pCwPoenFCgEC0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTyk6NgmdG22emPAW1MElAr11J80uXfpsgzmtBfUf2EiA&oe=6B0475E9"}, {"file_name": "512x512_v2.png", "id": "3729118427178426", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036625_3729118430511759_4627366791325516755_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=guDQfV89o3gQ7kNvwHU5ZuY&_nc_oc=AdoVFhrqAWf48UeTn6KJbTbX5vHlsXo8aJ10j10IbXGY96QvyJMGZEFiDL886aDbOV0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRD59IvKf4bQLguveCEdS9jnhbtFQqKoB2dF8ZIeTti8A&oe=6B048851"}, {"file_name": "1008x1440_03.png", "id": "524579182268135", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982601_524579188934801_9078192405625921499_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IcyK3DE58mQQ7kNvwFsZEax&_nc_oc=AdpmjYx1HBqfKL2hY4fC5_9FvYLRyWEf7TtVKP5kgwVR-Bj4sP00UdP6iQZsCpXYJUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSZlB97wFJL9It92x8kUARcnS3S0btB25cMZ8uVdRh3og&oe=6B046DD9"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_03.png", "id": "461922361721150", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974558_461922365054483_3754652912688728093_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qwqs8WA4w-kQ7kNvwEEKJDG&_nc_oc=AdoB7Z5T_jqLvOvA5gpPySy8hVhbCqD23_8FTix1Lj5HS8fi4WTOiNM5kUNwvwj2rds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQoEYvJ4JSthwB9VVk1hp2vCF7n-4Kpgl2dTWi2E-c97Q&oe=6B0467FA"}, {"file_name": "1080x360_03.png", "id": "444808726952535", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75195907_444808730285868_1611734158111743028_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless